          <groundspeak:finder id="12442378">mikefromcanmore</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 194 Pincher Creek (FOUND).  Took awhile to grab this one.  The grass is really starting to grow and the dirt had once again covered over the cap.  The alternate coordinates provided by one of the earlier finders helped us zero in on the location.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
