          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP194 Pincher Creek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Posted: N49° 29.229' W113° 56.454'

My GPSr: N49° 29.22[b]8'[/b] W113° 56.45[b]8[/b]'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous context photos were the key to finding this one! I used them to figure out where to start looking and sure enough after removing some grass, there was the cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

