          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP194 Pincher Creek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I had a little luck on my side as this cap was found fairly quickly. There was no marker post or any tell tale depression for this cap. Unfortunately ran out of time to find the other cap close by. Will have to come back for another visit. TFTBC&lt;/p&gt;

